# KEYS recorded over a recorded PIANO, all on TRACKS (the device starts a take on the first note): while a take records
# or waits for its first note, the keys PLAY - before, white 1-6 picked tracks and black 1-6 muted them: "KEYS silent"
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
onnote 1
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect page 11
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect track 0
# the piano: REC, the first note starts it (white 1, 3, 5: on TRACKS, while waiting)
tap REC
wait 200
key w0 down 90
key w2 down 90
key w4 down 90
wait 2500
key w0 up
key w2 up
key w4 up
wait 3000
tap REC
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect track 0
expect eventsA1 >2
# KEYS: picked on TRACKS (not recording: white 2 picks it), REC, the low keys play and record
tapkey w1
wait 100
expect track 1
tap REC
wait 200
key w2 down 100
wait 100
expect track 1
expect playing 1
expect tvoices2 >0
expect tvoices1 >0
key w2 up
wait 300
key b1 down 100
wait 200
expect pmask 0
expect tvoices2 >0
key b1 up
wait 3000
tap REC
wait 300
expect eventsA2 >1
expect eventsA1 >2
# not recording: the keys are the track keys again
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect track 0
tap PLAY
wait 200
